  (text "BTN1..4: 3.3V pull-up in the KVM, press = 0V\n  [A3,A4,A5] -> ESP OPEN-DRAIN:\n  Low = press, Hi-Z = release. NEVER High.\nLED1..4: 3.3V common, KVM IC sinks\n  lit = 0V (Active Low) [A6,A7],\n  no auto-scan [A8] -> GPIO input.\nTODO(hw-verify): LED off-level / pull-up,\n  reverse-feed (KVM on, ESP off), GND." (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 419.1 191.77 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05) (color 40 20 20 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "bdd7135c-a4fd-5287-b7d9-9a6a2a9cc8a9")
  )
