  (text "74HC4052: VEE = ~E = GND (always enabled), A/B = KVM_A0/KVM_A1 shared with the 74HC139.\nPC front panel: LED+ -> 390 ohm -> relay input LED; output 3.3V -> contact -> 4.7k to GND.\nTODO(hw-verify): 4052 pinout/Ron@3.3V (datasheet), relay If/Vf, PC header polarity/voltage [C1,C4]." (exclude_from_sim no)
