  (text "SAFETY RULES, PCB-FIXED I/F & TODO(hw-verify) NOTES\n- [H3] NEVER connect J3 #1 (VCC_5V) to PC VBUS. NEVER connect X630 #2 (HDET=4.8V).\n- [PLAN 4.4] ATX/KVM ctrl & LED sense MUST use direct GPIO (NEVER MCP23017).\n- Invariant 4: Keep both ~E_* High when changing A0/A1 (R3/R4 100k PD, R5/R6 10k PU).\n- KVM: button = ESP OPEN-DRAIN (Low=press, never High); LED = Active Low (lit=0V) [A3-A8, Issue #180].\n  Check reverse-feed (KVM on/ESP off) and common GND before connecting the KVM harness.\n- PROVISIONAL GPIOs: A0/A1 P1#35/#34, ~E_PWR/~E_RST #32/#31, KVM_BTN1 #24, KVM_LED1..4 #26/#25/#22/#21,\n  KVM_BTN2..4 #2/#7/#9 (GPIO19/15/14), PC_PWR_L #10 (GPIO6), PC_HDD_L #1 (GPIO54). No spare GPIO left.\n- PCB-Fixed (internal): H2 UART (G37/38), J4 100M ETH (G28-31,34,35,49-52), TF1 SD (G39-45),\n  U9/U11 Audio (G9-13,53 + shared I2C; check ES8311 addr [G2]), Strapping (G34-38)." (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 467.36 317.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.12 1.12) (color 40 20 20 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "74671164-7b40-5ae4-a0d5-3fda7568d891")
  )
  (sheet_instances
    (path "/" (page "1"))
  )
